   "title": "IMF raises Korea's 2026 growth forecast to 3.9% on chip boom",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/economy/20261117/imf-raises-koreas-2026-growth-forecast-to-39-on-chip-boom",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
