   "title": "Culture ministry to survey rights of underage idols next year, following NYT report on NewJeans",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/entertainment/k-pop/20261117/culture-ministry-to-survey-rights-of-underage-idols-next-year-following-nyt-report-on-newjeans",
