   "summary": "LIG Defense & Aerospace (LIG D&A) said Tuesday a court had granted its request to suspend a two-year ban on its participation in defense procurement bids imposed by Korea's arms procurement agency. LIG D&A sought a suspension of the ban from the Seoul Administrative Court after the Defense Acquisition Program Administration (DAPA) imposed the sanction last month following the indictment of company executives on charges of bribing a DAPA official in connection with weapons procurement tenders.",
   "summary_zh": "LIG航空航天（LIG D&A）周二表示，法院已批准其请求，暂缓执行韩国武器采购机构对其参与防务采购投标实施的两年禁令。上月，国防采购事业局（DAPA）在该公司高管因涉嫌在武器采购招标中向DAPA官员行贿而遭起诉后，对该公司实施制裁；LIG D&A随后向首尔行政法院申请暂缓执行该禁令。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "LIG Defense & Aerospace (LIG D&A) said Tuesday a court had granted its request to suspend a two-year ban on its participation in defense procurement bids imposed by Korea's arms procurement agency. LIG D&A sought a suspension of the ban from the Seoul Administrative Court after the Defense Acquisition Program Administration (DAPA) imposed the sanction last month following the indictment of company executives on charges of bribing a DAPA official in connection with weapons procurement tenders. In a regulatory filing, LIG D&A said the court suspended the ban pending a first-instance ruling in its lawsuit challenging the sanction. If the company wins, it can continue bidding for defense contracts. If it loses, the two-year ban will take effect 30 days after the ruling. LIG D&A said it will work to keep its weapons development projects on track, minimize the impact on its business partners and maintain strong ties with overseas customers",
