   "_dt": 1794905822.0,
   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Korean artificial intelligence (AI) startup Upstage has joined forces with Canadian company Cohere to develop sovereign AI — systems built and controlled locally to keep sensitive data and infrastructure independent of foreign tech giants — as they pursue enterprise customers in Korea and overseas. Upstage said Tuesday it had signed a strategic partnership with Cohere, which specializes in sovereign AI for regulated industries and government agencies.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国人工智能初创公司Upstage已与加拿大公司Cohere携手开发主权人工智能，即在当地构建和控制、使敏感数据及基础设施不受外国科技巨头影响的系统，以争取韩国及海外企业客户。Upstage周二表示，已与专门为受监管行业和政府机构提供主权人工智能的Cohere签署战略合作协议。",
   "summarySource": "index",
   "body": "Korean artificial intelligence (AI) startup Upstage has joined forces with Canadian company Cohere to develop sovereign AI — systems built and controlled locally to keep sensitive data and infrastructure independent of foreign tech giants — as they pursue enterprise customers in Korea and overseas. Upstage said Tuesday it had signed a strategic partnership with Cohere, which specializes in sovereign AI for regulated industries and government agencies. The agreement brings together Upstage's proprietary large language models, Solar Pro and Solar Mini, and its document-processing technology, Document Parse, with Cohere's enterprise agentic AI platform, North. The integrated solutions will be offered to companies and institutions in finance, government and manufacturing, where data security and regulatory compliance are critical. Customers will be able to deploy the technology through on-pr",
