   "ageDays": 0.02,
   "summary": "Russia attacked two major bridges over the Dnipro River in Kyiv on Monday night, with air strikes cutting water and heating supplies in parts of the Ukrainian capital, the city’s mayor, Vitali Klitschko, said Tuesday morning. Missiles hit the city’s Northern and Southern bridges, Klitschko said, and caused damage to critical infrastructure.",
   "summary_zh": "基辅市市长瓦季·克利奇科周二上午表示，俄罗斯周一夜间袭击了基辅境内第聂伯河上的两座大型桥梁，空袭还切断了乌克兰首都部分地区的供水和供暖。克利奇科称，导弹击中了该市的北部大桥和南部大桥，并造成关键基础设施受损。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Russia attacked two major bridges over the Dnipro River in Kyiv on Monday night, with air strikes cutting water and heating supplies in parts of the Ukrainian capital, the city’s mayor, Vitali Klitschko, said Tuesday morning. Missiles hit the city’s Northern and Southern bridges, Klitschko said, and caused damage to critical infrastructure. “Some areas are experiencing disruptions to water and heating supplies,” he wrote on Telegram . Ukrainian officials said parts of Kyiv’s above-ground metro were also damaged. Eight bridges link the two banks of the city of around 3 million people. Several of the structures were targeted by Russian drones in October. Meanwhile, Ukraine struck the Kerch Bridge linking Russia to occupied Crimea for a second consecutive day , the peninsula’s Moscow-installed head Sergei Aksyonov said on Telegram , adding that traffic across the bridge had been suspended. He also said two people died in the Lininsky District following an overnight drone attack. The overnight strikes followed online talks on Monday between U.S., Ukrainian and European officials aimed at ending the war, attended by U.S. envoys Jared Kushner and Steve Witkoff. In an evening address on Monday, Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy called the meeting “difficult” and said more had to be done to help Ukraine defend itself against Russian ballistic missiles. He added that Russia was receiving “dozens of missiles per month” from North Korea and warned that Moscow could launch fresh missile attacks on Ukraine overnight and into Tuesday",
