   "title": "Export duty on diesel hiked ₹2.5/litre, ATF ₹1.5/litre, petrol remains nil",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/business/Industry/export-duty-on-diesel-hiked-25litre-atf-15litre-petrol-remains-nil/article71710215.ece",
