   "_dt": 1794842639.0,
   "ageDays": 0.75,
   "summary": "The lack of a finalized South China Sea code under the Philippines’ chairship was expected given a series of thorny “milestone issues” that remain difficult to resolve, maritime law expert Jay Batongbacal earlier said. READ: Failure to finalize South China Sea code was expected – expert “It’s not unexpected, and I think even within the different ministries of the different countries, they also were aware of that possibility.",
   "summary_zh": "海事法专家杰伊·巴通巴卡尔早些时候表示，鉴于一系列棘手的“里程碑问题”仍难以解决，预计菲律宾担任主席国期间无法完成《南海行为准则》的最终定稿在意料之中。阅读：专家称，未能完成《南海行为准则》定稿在意料之中——“这并不出人意料，我认为，即使在不同国家、不同部门内部，他们也知道存在这种可能性。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "“If I rely on the good faith of an adversary in my job as defense secretary, then they might as well find somebody else,” he added. On Sunday, Foreign Affairs Secretary Ma. Theresa Lazaro said negotiators had made substantial progress but remained divided on key issues, including the code’s geographic scope, definition of terms and whether it would be legally binding. She said the parties had reached a provisional agreement on about 80 percent of the draft, up from roughly 50 percent when the Philippines assumed the Asean chairmanship. The lack of a finalized South China Sea code under the Philippines’ chairship was expected given a series of thorny “milestone issues” that remain difficult to resolve, maritime law expert Jay Batongbacal earlier said. He had earlier assessed that there was a “big chance” negotiations over the COC would not be concluded this year, as Manila pushed to finalize the binding agreement under its leadership. READ: Failure to finalize South China Sea code was expected – expert “It’s not unexpected, and I think even within the different ministries of the different countries, they also were aware of that possibility. So it’s not surprising,” he told the same forum. Asean and China pledged in 2002 to come up with a COC on the South China Sea, a framework that seeks to prevent conflict through diplomatic means but it has remained elusive due to slow progress. /dl Your subscription could not be saved. Please try again. Your subscription has been successful. For comprehensive coverage, in-depth analysis, visit our special page for West Philippine Sea updates . Stay informed with articles, videos, and expert opinions",
