   "title": "Korea seeks to reconstruct aging embassy in US amid uncertainty over funding",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/globalcommunity/20261116/korea-seeks-to-reconstruct-aging-embassy-in-us-amid-uncertainty-over-funding",
